## Features
- Festive Gingerbread House Design;
- Animated Rotating Train & Warm LEDs;
- 8 Classic Christmas Tunes;
- Battery Powered with Non-Slip Base;
- Hand-Painted Polyresin Craftsmanship;

## Information
Capture the holiday spirit with this hand-painted gingerbread house decoration, finished with snow details. Illuminated by warm white LEDs, it features an animated train rotating around the base and plays 8 classic Christmas melodies. The switch allows you choose between lights with music or lights only. Powered by batteries for cordless placement, it includes a non-slip base to protect tabletop surfaces while bringing nostalgic festive cheer to your mantel or entryway.

## Features
- Santa sways and sings festively;
- Sensors activate with a clap;
- Classic red outfit with gifts;
- Bendable arms for custom poses;
- Cord-free battery-powered setup;

## Information
Looking to give your indoor decor a neighborhood-stopping holiday statement? This life-size HOMCOM Santa Claus figure turns any room into an engaging festive display. Activated by touch or sound, he sways his body and sings cheerful Christmas music. Dressed in a red velvet fabric suit, Santa Claus holds two wrapped gift boxes in hand and carries a candy cane. Thanks to flexible wire arms, you can adjust his posture for dynamic holiday displays or welcoming poses that bring seasonal cheer.

## Features
- 240 warm white LEDs with 8 lighting modes;
- 3-piece reindeer and sleigh set for festive charm;
- Sturdy powder-coated metal frame;
- 6H on/18H off daily timer for easy lighting;
- Weather-resistant rattan with no glitter shedding;

## Information
Transform your garden, porch, or indoor space into a festive wonderland with this 3-piece light-up reindeer and sleigh set. Crafted with brown PP rattan and a strong metal frame, these holiday decorations feature warm white LEDs with 8 lighting modes, from steady glow to flashing, plus a daily timer. Enjoy a mess-free rattan display with no glitter cleanup.

## Features
- 200 cool white LEDs with 8 lighting modes;
- 3-piece deer family with rainbow effects;
- Sturdy powder-coated metal frame;
- 6H on/18H off daily timer for effortless lighting;
- Weather-resistant rattan with no glitter or mess;

## Information
Transform your home into a magical winter scene with this 3-piece iridescent reindeer family. Reflective PET strips, cool white LEDs, 8 lighting modes and a timer create a dazzling holiday display. IP44-rated with a safe low-voltage adapter, it's ideal for porches and yards.

## Features
- 200 warm white LEDs with 8 lighting modes;
- 3-piece rattan-look reindeer family;
- IP44-rated body for sheltered outdoor use;
- Daily timer with 6H on/18H off cycle;
- Adds festive charm to patios and pathways;

## Information
Transform your home with this 3-piece light-up reindeer family. Crafted with realistic brown PP rattan, it features 200 warm white LEDs, 8 modes and a daily timer. IP44-rated for sheltered outdoor use with a 4.5V low-voltage adapter.
